### Public class check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/class

### Public API information
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/info

### Public API documentation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/docs

### Login as seeded admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@example.com",
    "password": "Admin@12345"
}

### Get all courses
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Get only one course
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/courses/6a7eea1a2ea649523eeb6a82
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Create one course
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "courseCode": "PL101",
    "title": "C++ Programming",
    "description": "An introductory course on C++ programming.",
    "category": "Programming",
    "level" : "Intermediate",
    "capacity": "FULL"
}

### Course report by category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/courses-by-category
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Course report by level
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/courses-by-level
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Course report by capacity
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/courses-by-capacity
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Course report by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/courses-by-status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Update course from frontend form
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/courses/6a84020f8a87acc00195a093
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
    "courseCode": "PL101",
    "title": "C++ Programming",
    "description": "An introductory course on C++ programming.",
    "category": "Programming",
    "level" : "Advanced",
    "capacity": "FULL",
    "status" : "ACTIVE"
}

### Enrolments per course report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/enrolments-per-course
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Most popular courses report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/popular-courses
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Enrolments by level report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/enrolments-overview
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Monthly enrolment totals report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/monthly-enrolments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
